    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dɛ-bo-ra kɛnɛ Ba-rak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jiäk lɛni nyɔk kɛ lätni nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, mëë ci E-ɣud li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱th tetdä Ya-bin kuäär Kɛ-naan min ruaac Ɣa-dhor. Kä bo̱o̱th rɛmdɛ mɔ Ci-cɛ-ra min ciɛŋ ni Ɣäro-cɛth-ɣa-go-yim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wiee nhiam Kuɔth Nhial görkɛ luäk. Kɛ ɣöö te kuäär ɛ mɔ kɛ thurbiɛɛli ko̱o̱r ti kur bäŋuan, cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ciɛŋ a bɛc kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Täämɛ Dɛ-bo-ra ɛ ciek mi gök Kuɔth, kä cɔalkɛ cɔwdɛ i̱ Lap-pi-doth, kä ɛ jɛn ruaac I-thɛ-rɛl ɔ ɛn guäth ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn la nyuurɛ thäri nööri Dɛ-bo-ra kam Rama kɛnɛ Beth-ɛl wi̱i̱ni päämni Ɛ-pa-rim. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl guk ruac ben go̱r kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ Ba-rak gat Ä-bi-no-am jäk kä raan kä Kɛ-dɛc wec Nap-ta-li. Kä cuɛ wee jiökɛ jɛ i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, ji̱ jiök i̱, ‘Wër, käni nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiath kɛl thok duëël Nap-ta-li kɛnɛ thok duëël Dhɛ-bu-lun, wiaa matdɛ rɔ pääm Ta-bor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä Ci-cɛ-ra, bo̱o̱th rɛmni Ya-bin in di̱i̱t jak kä wä raar, kä bɛ röm kɛ yɛ rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Ki-con kɛ thurbiɛɛlikɛ. Kä bä ji̱ ka̱m jucdiɛn.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ba-rak ɛ loc i̱, “Mi bi wä kɛɛl kɛ ɣä, ɣän bä wä. Kä mi /ci bi wä kɛɛl kɛ ɣä, ɣän /cä bi wä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dɛ-bo-ra wee, “Ɛ puc ɣän bä wä kɛɛl kɛ ji̱. Kɛ ɣöö ɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p in bi ji̱ naŋ /ca bi liak ni ji̱, kɛ ɣöö Kuoth Nhial bɛ Ci-cɛ-ra la̱th tetdä ciek.” Ɛ jɛn cu Dɛ-bo-ra wä kɛnɛ Ba-rak kä Kɛ-dɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ba-rak Dhɛ-bu-lun kɛnɛ Nap-ta-li cɔal kä Kɛ-dɛc. Kä cu wutni ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ wäl jɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r. Kä cu Dɛ-bo-ra wä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci Ɣɛ-bɛr raan Kɛɛn kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Ɣo-bab gua̱nthu Muthɛ rɔ koc kä ji̱ Kɛɛn, cɛ wä pua̱t ni kä Dhä-nä-nim thaar jiaath in di̱i̱t thiekä Kɛ-dɛc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ca Ci-cɛ-ra jiök i̱ ci Ba-rak gat Ä-bi-no-am wä wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m Ta-bor, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuɛ thurbiɛɛli köörɛ ti kur bäŋuan ciööl raar kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tëë te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, kä Ɣäro-cɛth-ɣa-go-yim wä kɛ rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Kir Ki-con. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dɛ-bo-ra Ba-rak jiök i̱, “Jiɛc rɔ! Ɛ jɛn cäŋ in ci Kuoth Nhial Ci-cɛ-ra la̱th tetädu thi̱n ɛnɛ. Bi Kuoth Nhial ji̱ ka̱m jucdɛ” Cu Ba-rak jiɛɛn kɛnɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ wäl wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m Ta-bor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Ci-cɛ-ra jak kä yi̱c kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ kɛ thurbiɛɛlikɛ diaal min cakɛ mak ɛ Ba-rak. Kä cu Ci-cɛ-ra käny piny rɛy thurbiɛɛlɛ kä cuɛ rɔ bar kɛ ciökɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ba-rak kɛ joc amäni Ɣäro-cɛth-ɣa-go-yim, cua rɛm Ci-cɛ-ra näk kɛn diaal. A cuɛ thil ram mi cu duɔth kɛ tëk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö ci Ci-cɛ-ra rɔ bar, cuɛ wä kä ciek Ɣɛ-bɛr, raan Kɛɛn mi cɔali Ya-el kɛ ciökɛ, kɛ ɣöö gɔaa kam Ya-bin kuäär Ɣa-dhor kɛnɛ dhɔr Ɣɛ-bɛr raan Kɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ya-el ben raar bëë Ci-cɛ-ra ben lor, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Ri̱i̱tni rɔ. Kuäärä, ti̱cni rɔ ɣä. Cu dual.” Ɛ jɛn cuɛ rɔ riet jɛ kä kɛmɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ kuɔ̱m piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ya-el jiök i̱, “Mi nhɔk i̱ jɛ, malä moc pi̱ ti maathä. Näk rɛw ɣä.” Ɛ Jɛn cuɛ jɛ moc cak kä cuɛ nyɔk kɛ kum piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ya-el nyɔk kɛ jio̱k i̱, “Cuŋni thok kɛmɛkä, mi wëë tekɛ ram thiec ji̱ i̱, ‘Tëë kɛ ram mia̱a̱ wa̱nɛ?’ Wër i̱, ‘Eey.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Ya-el ciek Ɣɛ-bɛr lo̱c kɛmɛkä ka̱n, kä cuɛ puɔ̱ɔ̱t ka̱n kä cuɛ wä kä jɛ a määth cuɛ lo̱c pua̱t raŋädɛ, min cɛ niɛɛn kɛ ɣöö cɛ cuuc, amäni min cɛ cop ni piny. Cuɛ cu li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ kɛ ɣöö guur Ba-rak Ci-cɛ-ra, cu Ya-el Ba-rak ben päth, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Bër ɛ ji̱ ba̱a̱ ben nyuɔ̱th ram in go̱o̱ri.” Cu Ba-rak wä rɛy kɛmɛkä ciek. Cuɛ Ci-cɛ-ra jek tɔ̱ɔ̱cä thi̱n cɛ li̱w a te lo̱c kɛmɛkä ni raŋdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛ mɔ cu Kuoth Ya-bin kuäär Kɛ-naan ka̱m ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
